# スライド (design 11.11, 11.2.6), for tools/ui_run.py: 実行 for a link of a slide, done by
# the shared part of lib/libtv (tv_vop.c). A slide document made from the template in the
# 原紙箱, a link to a text (TADjsについて, copied out of 仮身サンプル) pasted into it, is
# shown with スライド (the steps of ui_slide_text.steps), and the menu opened on two links of
# the text the slide lays out: 実身/仮身 at 100,139 and 基本文章編集 at 215,504 (閉じる under
# the pointer, 実行 the twelfth row, 240 below; 再表示, chosen to put the menu away, 120
# below, and under the pointer the next time). 実行 is on and opens its list of programs (the
# console says "exec menu on"): the menu's tail, ウインドウ, 小物 and 実行, is the common one
# (SYSDEF_MENU_TAIL); its 実行 is left as the program set it (dt_tail_fill greys it only when
# the program did not). The pictures were recorded with that list shown.
